    "text": "DOMINICA V IN QUADRAGESIMA.\nHer seg\u00fe hu se \u00e6\u00feela lareow w\u00e6s sprecende; he cw\u00e6\u00fe, Men \u00fea leofestan, \u00e6rest us gedafena\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t we\nHu nyt bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6m men \u00feeh he geornlice gehyre \u00fea word \u00fe\u00e6s halgan godspelles, gif he \u00fea nel on his\nHu m\u00e6g he gastlicne w\u00e6stm \u00feonne habban & healdan, gif he ne wile hine him to Gode gelyfan, & mid\n& he for\u00feon \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00fe: Se mon se \u00fea so\u00fef\u00e6stnesse mid his mu\u00fee sprec\u00fe, & hie on his heortan georne\nManiges mannes wise bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he wile symle to his nehstan sprecan \u00fea word \u00fee he wen\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t him\nDeofles wise bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he wile symle \u00feone unwaran man beswican \u00feurh \u00fea swetnesse \u00feara synna, & eft\nManige men beo\u00fe \u00fee \u00fea word \u00fe\u00e6re halgan ges\u00e6gene lustlice gehyra\u00fe, & \u00feeah hr\u00e6dlice hie forgyta\u00fe\nFor\u00feon hie gastlicne w\u00e6stm ne bera\u00fe, ne mid him nabba\u00f0; for\u00feon \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t halige s\u00e6d on him gedwan &\nManige men beo\u00f0 \u00fee beforan o\u00ferum mannum hw\u00e6t hugu god beganga\u00fe, & ra\u00fee hie hit anforl\u00e6ta\u00fe;\nNe \u00fe\u00e6t to nahte nyt ne bi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t man godne mete ete o\u00fe\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t betste win on gebeorscipe drince, gif \u00fe\u00e6t\nSwa we \u00feonne \u00fea gastlican lare unw\u00e6rlice ne sceolan anforl\u00e6tan, \u00fee ure saul big leofa\u00fe & feded bi\u00f0;\nFor\u00feon myccle swi\u00f0or we sceolan \u00feencan be \u00fe\u00e6m gastlicum \u00feingum \u00feonne be \u00fe\u00e6m lichomlicum.\nSe lichoma on \u00feisse worlde \u00feingum gewite\u00fe, swa \u00feonne seo saul mid gastlicum \u00feingum on ecnesse\nManige men beo\u00f0 heardre heortan \u00fee \u00fea godcundan lare gehyra\u00fe, & him mon \u00fea oft boda\u00fe & s\u00e6g\u00fe, &\nFor\u00feon began we ure mod from \u00fe\u00e6re lufan \u00feisse worlde synlustum & gitsungum, \u00fee l\u00e6s us \u00feisse\nHw\u00e6t we witon \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc wlite & \u00e6lc f\u00e6gernes to ende efste\u00fe & onette\u00fe \u00feisse weorlde lifes; for\u00feon se\nFor\u00feon, men \u00fea leofestan, ic eow bidde & halsige \u00fe\u00e6t anra manna gehwylc sceawige hine sylfne on his\nWe witon \u00fe\u00e6t Crist sylfa cw\u00e6\u00fe \u00feurh his sylfes mu\u00fe, \u00feonne ge geseo\u00fe growende & blowende ealle\nSwa \u00feonne gelice bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re menniscan gecynde \u00fe\u00e6s lichoman, \u00feonne se geogo\u00fehad \u00e6rest blowe\u00fe &\n& eal se lichoma geunlusta\u00fe \u00fea geogo\u00f0lustas to fremmenne \u00fea \u00fee he \u00e6r hatheortlice lufode, & him\nHie him \u00feonne eft swi\u00fee bitere \u00feenca\u00fe, \u00e6fter \u00feon \u00fee se dea\u00f0 him tocyme\u00fe Godes dom to abeodenne.\nSe lichoma \u00feonne on \u00feone heardestan stenc & on \u00feone fulostan bi\u00f0 gecyrred, & his eagan \u00feonne beo\u00fe\nHw\u00e6r bi\u00f0 la \u00feonne se idla lust, & seo swetnes \u00fe\u00e6s h\u00e6med\u00feinges \u00fee he \u00e6r hatheortlice lufode?\nHw\u00e6r beo\u00fe \u00feonne \u00fea symbelnessa, & \u00fea idelnessa, & \u00fea ungemetlican hleahtras, & se leasa gylp, &\nEalle \u00fea gewita\u00fe swa swa wolcn, & swa swa w\u00e6teres stream, & ofer \u00fe\u00e6t nahw\u00e6r eft ne \u00e6teowa\u00fe.\n\u00deyllic bi\u00f0 se ende \u00fe\u00e6s lichoman f\u00e6gernesse, \u00fee nu dysige men & unwise swi\u00fee lufia\u00fe.\nFor\u00feon hi ne besceawia\u00fe no hu late hi on \u00feysne middangeard acennede wurdon, & hu ra\u00fee hi him eft of\nHw\u00e6t is \u00fe\u00e6t lif elles \u00feysses middangeardes buton lytelu ylding \u00fe\u00e6s dea\u00fees?\nEal swylce seo lange mettrumnes bi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6s seocan mannes, \u00feonne hine god forl\u00e6tan nele e\u00feelice lifian,\nSwy\u00fee so\u00felice we magon ge\u00feencan \u00fe\u00e6t hit bi\u00fe dea\u00fees ylding, swi\u00feor \u00feonne lifes.\nHwylc man is \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6ge ariman ealle \u00fea sar & \u00fea brocu \u00fee se man to gesceapen is?\nOn synne he bi\u00f0 geeacnod, & on his modor sare he bi\u00f0 acenned, on hungre, & on \u00feurste, & on cyle he\n& \u00feonne se synnfulla on \u00fe\u00e6m helle fyre cwicsusle his lif geenda\u00fe.\nWa bi\u00fe \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6m mannum \u00fee ne ongyta\u00fe \u00feisse worlde yrm\u00fea, \u00fee hie to gesceapene beo\u00fe, & hie\nNe hie ne ongyta\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t hi on fruman to Godes hiwunga gesceapene w\u00e6ron, & eac to \u00feon ecan life, n\u00e6s\n& hie ne besceawia\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6tte a seo duru \u00fe\u00e6s heofonlican rices bi\u00fe ontyned \u00fe\u00e6m rihtgelyfendum\n& hie na ne besceawia\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t se gifra helle bi\u00f0 a open deoflum & \u00fe\u00e6m mannum \u00fee nu be his larum\nS\u00e6gd is \u00fe\u00e6t se ilca wi\u00feerwearda \u00fee him \u00e6r \u00fea synna l\u00e6rde, \u00fe\u00e6t se hi mote eft mid mycclum witum\nOn helle beo\u00fe \u00feeofas, & flyteras, & gitseras \u00fee on mannum heora \u00e6hta on woh nima\u00fe, & \u00fea\nBe \u00fe\u00e6m demum Crist sylf w\u00e6s sprecende; he cw\u00e6\u00fe, Deme ge nu, swa swa ge willon \u00fe\u00e6t eow sy eft\nCu\u00felice se yfela dema onfeh\u00fe medmycclum feo, & onwende\u00fe \u00feone rihtan dom for \u00fe\u00e6s feos lufon.\nS\u00e6gd is \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t he onfo \u00fe\u00e6re ecan geny\u00feerunga mid deoflum; for\u00feon \u00fee he \u00e6r on \u00feissum\n\u00de\u00e6r he h\u00e6f\u00fe weallendene leg, & hwilum cyle \u00feone grimmestan, eal sar & sace, hungor & \u00feurst, wop\nNe \u00feearf he \u00fe\u00e6r n\u00e6fre leohtes wenan, ne \u00fe\u00e6s freondes \u00fee hine \u00e6fre of \u00fe\u00e6s grimman deofles\nFor\u00feon, men \u00fea leofestan, us is mycel \u00feearf to witenne \u00fe\u00e6t Iudas nu is cwylmed mid deoflum on \u00fe\u00e6m\nHi habba\u00fe demena naman, & scea\u00feena d\u00e6da; for\u00feon hi beo\u00fe betuh him sylfum slitende wulfas, \u00feonne\nHim w\u00e6s mid rihte beboden \u00fe\u00e6t hi sceoldan symle \u00fe\u00e6m unriht dondum mid grimnesse steran,\nNis \u00fe\u00e6t no be eallum demum gelice to secggenne; for\u00feon \u00fee sume myccle swi\u00feor rihta\u00fe Godes folc\n\u00dea deman beo\u00fe swi\u00feor to herigenne \u00feonne to leanne; for\u00feon hi willa\u00fe styran \u00fe\u00e6m ungelyfedum\n\u00dea deman beo\u00fe on Godes fultome \u00e6ghw\u00e6r, ge \u00fe\u00e6t hie him selfum heora synna bebeorga\u00fe, ge eac o\u00fere\nFor\u00feon on domes d\u00e6g hi beo\u00fe from Gode \u00feysne cwide geherende \u00fee he cwi\u00fe: \u00feu goda \u00feeow, & \u00feu\n\u00deonne sceal ure anra gehwylc beran his d\u00e6da beforan Cristes heahsettle, & ealra his haligra, & \u00feonne\nManige men wena\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t mor\u00feor sy seo m\u00e6ste synne.\nAc us is to witenne \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fereora cynna syndon mor\u00feras, \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6rest, \u00fe\u00e6t man to o\u00ferum\nSwi\u00fee seldon \u00e6nig man wile beon andetta \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00e6festig sy, o\u00fe\u00fee t\u00e6lend.\nSe mon se \u00fee o\u00feerne acwel\u00fe, & inst\u00e6pes hine sylfne ongyte\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6t he mycel man & myccle synne\nWitodlice \u00fea \u00e6fstigan men, & \u00fea t\u00e6lendan, \u00feeh hi syn \u00fe\u00e6s mor\u00feres scyldige, hi hit him to nanre synne\n\u00dea \u00e6fstigan, \u00feeah hi syn dea\u00fees scyldige, hie heora scylda ne ongyta\u00fe; for\u00feon \u00fee hie n\u00e6fre\n\u00deeo dea\u00feberende uncyst us is eallum to onscunienne, \u00fee l\u00e6s hi us besencean on helle grund.\nCu\u00felice \u00fe\u00e6t wuldor \u00feysses middangeardes is sceort & gewitende; Drihtnes wuldor \u00feonne, & his rice\n\u00de\u00e6r is \u00fe\u00e6t ece leoht buton \u00feeostrum, \u00fe\u00e6r is geogo\u00fe buton ylde, \u00fe\u00e6r is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6\u00feele lif buton geendunge,\nNe bi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6r hungor, ne \u00feurst, ne wind, ne gewenn, ne w\u00e6tres sweg, ne \u00fe\u00e6r ne bi\u00f0 leofra gedal, ne la\u00fera\nAc \u00fe\u00e6r bi\u00fe seo ece r\u00e6ste, & haligra symbelnes \u00fe\u00e6r \u00feurhwuna\u00fe.\n\u00de\u00e6r is \u00fe\u00e6t unasecggenlice rice \u00fee God syle\u00fe eallum \u00f0\u00e6m \u00fee hine lufian willa\u00fe.\nLufian we hine \u00feonne mid eallre ure heortan megolnesse, \u00feonne lufa\u00fe he us on heofenum mid eallum\nA to widan feore sy urum Drihtne lof, & wuldor, & weor\u00femynd, abuton ende, on ecnesse; Amen.",
